    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CABARET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the game takes place in: Lumi\u00e8re Du N\u00e9ant, a fascinating, unreal, and mysterious place, in equal parts,\u00a0where evil and perversion corrupt everyone who enters\u00a0it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NARRATIVE-DRIVEN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the different characters who have been corrupted\u00a0by the curse of the masks that emanates from the\u00a0cabaret. Discover their darkest secrets and find a way to\u00a0escape the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the cabaret in order to advance inside its\u00a0flaunting and mysterious rooms, hiding from enemies\u00a0and solving all kinds of intricate situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to get through areas guarded by\u00a0workers. They are looking for you in the least expected places, nowhere is safe. Be careful not to get\u00a0caught!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CABARET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the game takes place in: Lumi\u00e8re Du N\u00e9ant, a fascinating, unreal, and mysterious place, in equal parts,\u00a0where evil and perversion corrupt everyone who enters\u00a0it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NARRATIVE-DRIVEN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the different characters who have been corrupted\u00a0by the curse of the masks that emanates from the\u00a0cabaret. Discover their darkest secrets and find a way to\u00a0escape the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the cabaret in order to advance inside its\u00a0flaunting and mysterious rooms, hiding from enemies\u00a0and solving all kinds of intricate situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to get through areas guarded by\u00a0workers. They are looking for you in the least expected places, nowhere is safe. Be careful not to get\u00a0caught!</p>",
